{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）中午11時58分，警方在黃大仙鳳德道近雙鳳街截獲一輛寶馬私家車，懷疑車上有違禁品，正召緝毒犬進一步調查。</p><p>據了解，警方在樂富富強街發現可疑車輛，尾隨跟蹤至富美街、鳯舞街，最終於上述位置截獲，惟司機不知所終，案件列販毒調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方截獲寶馬疑涉販毒。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197178546456367104259036.jpeg/R1rKGsWbChSr4Mm3Roq9iLIdWS7lNxx_BhdqlwYXapc\"/><figcaption>警方截獲寶馬疑涉販毒。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:33:16.076575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:25:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.053880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.053880+00:00","content_hash":"0ef02d78fdb056386004f08a915f9adcc53cd4ac67598a193fae4e8ef1ace914","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}